Third-party components and services

The live application uses Telethon, FastAPI, Pydantic, httpx and Instructor;
their own licenses and notices remain with their distributions. OpenRouter is
the hosted model provider, Xpoz supplies a sampled X index, and OKX's public
market API supplies spot-price context where available. These service names do
not imply endorsement by their operators.

Public Telegram posts, publisher RSS articles, Reddit posts and selected X
posts are content sources. Their text and links remain attributable to their
respective authors and platforms; AstraFeed links displayed quotes to the
source posts.
